cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code, or check the pre-registration trail it carries,
  please cite the paper below."
title: "Initialisation Sets the Conditioning of LoRA Merging"
abstract: "Merge implementations, evaluation harness, subspace-geometry audit,
  twelve pre-registration documents and per-cell result files for the paper of
  the same name. The commit ordering is the point of this repository: every
  pre-registration was committed before the compute it governs was dispatched,
  and that sequence is checkable with git merge-base rather than taken on
  trust."
